## Troubleshooting

### Content not updating
```bash
# Clear generated data and rebuild
rm src/data/resume-data.json
npm run parse-resume
npm run build
```

### Icons not showing
```bash
# Verify files exist
ls -la public/*.png public/*.svg

# Regenerate
npm run generate-icons
npm run build
```

### Build fails
```bash
# Check parser output
npm run parse-resume

# Verify JSON is valid
node -e "require('./src/data/resume-data.json')"

# Fresh install
rm -rf node_modules dist
npm install
npm run build
```

### Dark mode not working
- Check `localStorage.getItem('darkMode')`
- Verify `.dark` class on `<html>` element
- Check CSS variable definitions in both `:root` and `.dark`

